    "a3": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "看不见才好。看得一清二楚的东西，事务所收三倍价钱。",
     "next": "a4",
     "choices": []
    },
    "a4": {
     "speaker": "hakuyo",
     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "诶——那上次那口井里的，你怎么只收了一倍？",
     "next": "a5",
     "choices": []
    },
    "a5": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "因为那口井欠我一次。……到了。台阶上面，就是村子里没人敢提的那块地。",
     "next": "",
     "choices": []
    },
    "h1": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "停。薄荷，看台阶边上那尊石钵——水面上有光。",
     "next": "h2",
     "choices": []
    },
    "h2": {
     "speaker": "hakuyo",
     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "冷冷的……蓝紫色的。可是凛音，那倒影里——没有我们。",
     "next": "h3",
     "choices": []
    },
    "h3": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "石钵照的不是人，是「缝隙」。水面亮起来的时候，逢魔的眼睛也睁开了。",
     "next": "",
     "choices": [
      {
       "text": "先退后一步，看清光的来路",
       "next": "h4a"
      },
      {
