     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "（压低声音）光是从水底浮上来的……像灯笼火，可是水下根本没有灯。",
     "next": "h5",
     "choices": []
