     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "别碰水面。……记住了：它现在只是「看」着我们，还不想把人拉下去。",
     "next": "h5",
     "choices": []
    },
    "h5": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "靠近石钵，按 E 确认那道倒影。看完就走——天黑之前，我们还有一场架要打。",
     "next": "",
     "choices": []
    },
    "r1": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "这条石阶……祖母讲过。她说小时候从山上下来，就是踩着这些台阶，一手牵着她娘，一手拎着那盏没送出去的灯。",
