     "speaker": "hakuyo",
     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "没送出去的灯？……委托单上写的是「查明异象的来路」——你从看到地名的那一刻起，就知道来路了吧。",
     "next": "r3",
     "choices": []
    },
    "r3": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "嗯。所以才接。「退魔寮乙字科，凛音——接下逢魔神社的夜巡。」这句话，我练了十年。",
     "next": "",
     "choices": []
    }
   }
