     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "钟就在头上。没有风，注连绳却是湿的……像被谁的眼泪泡过。",
     "next": "c3",
     "choices": []
    },
    "c3": {
     "speaker": "hakuyo",
     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "我看过了，这口吊钟是旧式送钟——不是报时用的，是给人「送行」的。鸣三响，起灵；鸣九响，下葬。",
     "next": "c4",
     "choices": []
