     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
     "side": "left",
     "text": "它昨夜鸣了几响？",
     "next": "c5",
     "choices": []
    },
    "c5": {
     "speaker": "hakuyo",
     "name": "薄荷",
     "color": "fuji_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "……三响。凛音，这口钟不是在报时，是在起灵。有人在这座神社里，办了一场没人看见的葬礼——办了七十年。",
     "next": "c6",
     "choices": []
    },
    "c6": {
     "speaker": "rinne",
     "name": "凛音",
     "color": "vermilion_500",
     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/rinne_half.png",
