     "portrait": "res://assets/chars/portraits/hakuyo_half.png",
     "side": "right",
     "text": "棺里没有尸气，凛音……棺底嵌着一面镜子。镜中的人，穿着七十年前的嫁衣。",
     "next": "m3",
     "choices": []
